              "value": "Your personal rune is connected more closely to your arcane bond. You gain the critical specialization effects of your arcane bonded weapon. In addition, whenever you critically hit a creature with your arcane bonded weapon, they begin to feel the pull of your sin, imposing a −2 circumstance penalty to saves against any of your curriculum or sin spells until the end of your next turn."
